This repository contains two different things, and only one of them is licensed
here. See README.md.

  1. The compiled front end and the generated aggregates — skill names, counts,
     co-occurrence, clusters, and the per-company matrix. MIT, below.

  2. Short verbatim excerpts from employers' job postings, carried as evidence
     so that each skill can be traced to the sentence that produced it — at most
     one sentence per skill. These remain the work of their authors, are
     reproduced as brief quotation for attribution, and are NOT licensed onward
     by this repository or by the terms below.

